080095D4 directional-position-return

All position loads and stores use r1 through r4. The incoming manager pointer remains in r0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/directional_interaction.c
+++ b/src/directional_interaction.c
@@ -86,4 +86,7 @@
     q->position.z += 0x3c;
     q->position.y += 0x14;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (u32)manager; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
